            </note>
            <note corresp="#d807-f4" n="64" xml:id="d807-f4-content">
                <p>Marshal Pietro Badoglio, Head of the Italian Government; for correspondence
                    regarding concern of the United States over maintenance of responsible
                    government in Italy, see <ref target="frus1943v02#pg_402">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1943, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, pp. 402</ref> ff. and <hi
                        rendition="#italic">post</hi>, <ref target="#pg996">pp. 996</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
